    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense but i'm having trouble visualizing it. can u give me a more detailed breakdown of the pressure change specifically? like how much of the lift comes from the pressure diff vs the air being pushed down? just trying to get a better sense of the balance between the two.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
